      that>|<cell|>>|<row|<cell|>|<cell|\<psi\>\<circ\>f\<circ\>\<varphi\><rsup|-1>:\<varphi\><around*|(|U|)>\<rightarrow\>\<psi\><around*|(|f<around*|(|U|)>|)><text|
      is a diffeomorphism of class >C<rsup|q>>|<cell|>>>>
