      Finally using [eqs: <reference|eq 23.128.15>, <reference|eq 23.131.14>,
      <reference|eq 23.133.15>] it follows by [definition:<reference|manifold
      diffeomorphism>] that\ 

      <\equation*>
        f:M\<rightarrow\>N<text| is a diffeomorphism>
      </equation*>
    </description>
  </proof>

